// Plain track: a 1-in-3 climb is too steep to push even an empty cart up. Gravity along the slope and
// rolling friction come to about 330 N on an 80 kg cart, more than a mole's 320 N push: the run-up carries it a
// step or two up the climb, and there the mole stalls, holding it. (Powered rail drives it up the same slope: powered_rail_climbs.)
map
##################################
#................................#
#................................#
#................................#
#...........#######..............#
#................................#
#........................======###
#.....................===#########
#..................===############
#...............===###############
#............===##################
#.@.......===#####################
#=========########################
##################################
##################################
##################################
end
give Cart 1
place 2 4 0 Cart
hold 10-300 right                 // keep pushing
expect 300 cartx < 16             // the run-up carries it onto the foot of the slope...
expect 300 carty > 9              // ...a step or two up at most (the top is at 5)
expect 300 cartv < 1              // and there it stalls, the mole holding it against the slope
expect 300 cartv > -1
